1
00:00:27,500 --> 00:00:32,500
I sit across from you right now.

2
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:38,500
My hands are shaking, cold and tight.

3
00:00:40,500 --> 00:00:45,500
I tell you, Mom, that Mark is gone.

4
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:52,000
I walk away into the light.

5
00:00:54,500 --> 00:00:59,500
A man who cannot lead the way,

6
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:05,500
Will try to break your soul inside.

7
00:01:07,500 --> 00:01:12,500
He tries to hide his inner flaw,

8
00:01:13,500 --> 00:01:18,500
Behind a wall of bitter pride.

9
00:01:23,500 --> 00:01:28,500
I speak of Paul, that nervous boy.

10
00:01:31,000 --> 00:01:35,500
He blushes when he hears my name.

11
00:01:37,000 --> 00:01:42,000
He doesn't grab or push too hard.

12
00:01:43,500 --> 00:01:48,500
He doesn't play a foolish game.

13
00:01:51,000 --> 00:01:56,000
Technique is something I can teach,

14
00:01:57,000 --> 00:02:02,000
But fire is born inside the chest.

15
00:02:04,000 --> 00:02:09,000
I stop my search for golden pins,

16
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:15,000
And give an honest heart my best.

17
00:02:21,000 --> 00:02:26,000
The toxic ash is clearing out.

18
00:02:27,500 --> 00:02:32,500
A quiet peace comes over me.

19
00:02:34,000 --> 00:02:39,000
He is a clean, unwritten page.

20
00:02:40,000 --> 00:02:45,000
That is the boy I want to see.

21
00:02:47,000 --> 00:02:52,000
The toxic ash is gone for good.

22
00:02:53,500 --> 00:02:58,500
I stare up at the ceiling tile.

23
00:03:00,000 --> 00:03:05,000
Next Sunday night upon the wood...

24
00:03:06,500 --> 00:03:11,500
I'll make that organ boy work a while.